[PLACEHOLDER: Compressed incremental backup archive]

This file represents an incremental compressed backup of changes made to the
data/ directory between 2025-10-20 and 2025-11-01.

To create actual incremental backup:
  find ../results ../llm_responses -type f -newermt "2025-10-20" -print0 | tar -czf 2025-11-01_incremental_backup.tar.gz --null -T -

Archive contents should include:
- Updated results files (new analysis outputs)
- Additional LLM responses (supplementary experiments)
- Revised annotations (post-adjudication updates)

Incremental backup metadata:
  Date: 2025-11-01
  Base snapshot: 2025-10-20_data_snapshot.tar.gz
  Size: ~45 MB (estimated)
  Compression: gzip
  Files: ~15 modified/new files
  Purpose: Capture changes after additional model evaluation rounds

Restore procedure:
  1. Extract base snapshot: tar -xzf 2025-10-20_data_snapshot.tar.gz
  2. Apply incremental: tar -xzf 2025-11-01_incremental_backup.tar.gz
